    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00019",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [A66][I67]ferror[/I67]()[/A66] or [A68][I69]feof[/I69]()[/A68] functions must\nbe used to distinguish between an error condition and an end-of-file condition.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A66": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/ferror.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I67": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A68": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/feof.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I69": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00020",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     3
    ],
    "text": "Because of possible differences in element length and byte ordering, files written using [A70][I71]fwrite[/I71]()[/A70] are application-dependent, and possibly cannot be read using [I72]fread[/I72]() by a\ndifferent application or by the same application on a different processor.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A70": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/fwrite.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I71": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I72": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
